    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "17 Westfield is a beautifully presented large four bedroom semi-detached house positioned on a cul de sac and the property has been very well maintained by its owner occupants. Located in a much sought after housing estate right in the heart of Kells town centre, this home stands out thanks to its generous layout, stylish finishes and its south facing back garden. \r\n\r\nThe house is positioned on a quiet road within the estate yet close to a large green space. 17 Westfield has been continuously modernised by its owner occupants therefore providing a home ready for immediate occupancy. On leaving Wesftield, an incoming home owner will have all of the town's amenities within only a short walk.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor provides for a spacious layout consisting of a sitting room with a bay window to the front, a guest WC, and an open plan kitchen/dining/lounge area to the rear. The first floor includes three double bedrooms with a master ensuite, a single bedroom and a main bathroom. With a practical design, well-proportioned rooms, and a strong sense of comfort throughout, this is a home that suits family life or anyone looking to enjoy a bit more space while staying close to everything Kells has to offer. \r\n\r\nWestfield is extremely well maintained by its residents, it has a pleasant green space in the middle of the estate and the estate enjoy the convenience of being within immediate proximity to a good array of amenities including schools, supermarkets, leisure facilities and restaurants.\r\n\r\nDirections\r\nFrom Kells town centre travel across Farrell Street onto Bective Street, turn right opposite Choice Store, passing the HSE offices, drive into Westfield, then turn left and the property is on the right hand side .\r\n\r\nViewings by appointment."
      },
